{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1018701-printed-material-on-korea","id":1018701,"title":"Printed material on... Korea?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-17T22:46:25-08:00","id":1018701,"title":"Printed material on... Korea?","content":"China and Japan get so much love from all over the world (especially the latter), but the Korean peninsula never seemed to get any attention from CofD books - or any fantasy works in the west, for all I know. (I do know WoD has something about Nagaraja hiding under the Green Court, and that it used to be a sanctuary of sorts for Asian Gurahl, but that's it)<br /> <br /> Are there truly no official work done here on this part of Northeast Asia?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T23:24:09-08:00","id":1018708,"title":"","content":"iirc, Korea has a setting in Promethean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T23:51:27-08:00","id":1018712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1018701-printed-material-on-korea?p=1018708#post1018708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">iirc, Korea has a setting in Promethean.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, although it pretty much only says that it's a good place to make Unfleshed. The Promethazine 2e settings aren't particularly detailed, unfortunately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12761-suzuki","name":"Suzuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12761_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T23:59:22-08:00","id":1018716,"title":"","content":"There's no Shadows of South Korea book, but there's few location books to begin with. There's a Seoul entry in Damnation City that mentions the Red Lama, but like the other entries it's just two paragraphs or so. And Beijing has a setting in Vampire the Requiem's second edition, which is in Northeast Asia, though not Korea.<br /> <br /> It's possible it will pop up at some point, but there doesn't seem to be much of a drive to make location books. Or there is, but the people who want location books tend to want it about a specific location they like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-18-2016, 03:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T09:56:57-08:00","id":1018834,"title":"","content":"Korea is on the long, long list of places little known or cared about by western pop culture, as far as we can tell there is such thing as a western pop culture. Brazil doesn't get much attention, and we're as western as USA, mind you.<br /> <br /> That said, in the last years Korea have being receiving a raising in attention, so maybe it's going to change for you. I wouldn't instantly think it good, though. Pop culture isn't known for being faithful to foreign cultures, anywhere, and some developments in the setting can really end up infuriating you more than adding anything. I have more hope with OP, but still isn't that great. They already did at least one very racist description about Brazil, IIRC. Something about Brazilians sharing a single car in entire communities.<br /> <br /> Personally, I like the take WW went with a couple of By Nights, or FASA did with Shadowrun in the past. Do something to help local gamers in creating the material about their home. It have to be made with care, since locals aren't necessarily well versed in everything they'll need, and most have a particular view over their homelands. But it is a way to produce material about several locations with greatly reduced cultural bias.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T19:07:24-08:00","id":1018995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1018701-printed-material-on-korea?p=1018834#post1018834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Korea is on the long, long list of places little known or cared about by western pop culture, as far as we can tell there is such thing as a western pop culture. Brazil doesn't get much attention, and we're as western as USA, mind you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah.... unfortunately it seems like &quot;K-Pop&quot; and &quot;Lets put Sci-Fi stuff in Seoul&quot; is one of the only things Western Culture is even aware of when it comes to Korea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T22:57:23-08:00","id":1019082,"title":"","content":"Though it's 1e, Winter Masques describes a South Korean freehold that is caste-based and may be been made by one of the gentry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum